- op: discuss  # 12b6
  at: '2026-07-02T07:03:41Z'  # 12b6
  by: agent  # 12b6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 12b6
  clock: 3  # 12b6
  nonce: 12b6  # 12b6
  message: "Fixed in PR #381 (merged b590c885ed). Root cause: refine_frameworks' AUTO-mode demote phase dropped manifest-detected spring-boot to dev_frameworks because its import patterns (org.springframework.boot only) did not match a Spring MVC controller's actual annotation import (org.springframework.web.bind.annotation); with profile.frameworks=[] enrich_symbols never loaded spring-boot.yaml, so no route/controller concept fired. Fix: broadened spring-boot's JAVA_FRAMEWORKS import patterns to include org.springframework.web/.stereotype/.context — import namespaces, not Maven group coords (spring-web's coord is org.springframework:spring-web), so _pattern_matches_deps adds no manifest-detection FP; only import-edge matching widens. Deliberately NOT autoload-by-convention (Rails) — Spring is imported like Django, so import validation stays active. Behavioral evidence (re-ran the item's OWN repro on merged dev b590c885ed, fixtures/route-parity/java/ via run_behavior_map): BEFORE profile.frameworks=[] and Ctrl.listUsers carried no concept; AFTER profile.frameworks=['spring-boot'], Ctrl class -> concept=controller, Ctrl.listUsers method -> concept=route. Route-parity gate: java moved from strict-xfail into ROUTE_GREEN (5/5 pass). Full local suite 100% (19917 passed). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation: flips java-Spring concept=route inert->live and widens spring-boot detection corpus-wide. Surfaced a separate PRE-EXISTING route-marker synthesis validation defect (filed WI-tufil; affects go/js/java equally)."  # 12b6
